{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_38","type":"agent_message","text":"# QA: PASS\n\n## Manual Testing\n- Built the workspace with `nix shell nixpkgs#cargo nixpkgs#rustc nixpkgs#gcc -c cargo build`. Output: `Finished dev profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 0.08s`.\n- Verified workspace membership and `tank_core` dependency isolation with `nix shell ... -c cargo metadata --no-deps --format-version 1` and `nix shell ... -c cargo tree -p tank_core`. Output showed the four workspace members `tank_core`, `tank_data`, `tank_tui`, `tank_scenarios`; `cargo tree` for `tank_core` listed only `rand`, `rand_chacha`, `serde`, `serde_json`, and `thiserror`, with no `ratatui`/`crossterm`.\n- Exercised `tank_core` from a standalone ad-hoc Rust consumer compiled with `rustc --edition 2021 ... --extern tank_core=target/debug/deps/libtank_core-*.rlib`. Key output:\n  - `GEOMETRY volume_l=20.000 surface_cm2=1000.000 ... wall_cm2=2800.000 ... top_factor=0.250`\n  - `SNAPSHOT tan=2.000 nh3=0.001902 nitrite=0.500 nitrate=5.000 phosphate=1.000 do=8.000 gh=3.952 kh=4.202 tds=128.000 conductivity=196.923 ph=6.254243`\n  - `QUEUE_BEFORE_STEP queued=2 detritus_g=0.00 ambient_c=24.0`\n  - `QUEUE_AFTER_STEP queued=0 detritus_g=1.25 ambient_c=25.5 day=0 hour=1 events=1 first_event_kind=Some(CycleProgressing)`\n  - `SAVEFILE has_schema=true has_app_version=true has_state=true has_queued_actions=true has_rng=true`\n  - `SAVE_RESTORE equal_state=true equal_queue=true`\n  - `INVALID_FEED field \\`grams\\` must be non-negative, got -0.1`\n  - `INVALID_WATER_CHANGE field \\`percent\\` must be in the range 0.0..=100.0, got 120`\n  - `INVARIANT_NEGATIVE_MASS invariant violation for \\`ammonia_total_mg_n_total\\` with value -0.2`\n  - `INVARIANT_CLAMP light_intensity=1.0 condition=1.0 microfauna_population=0.0 event_log_len=200 oldest_kept=event-5 newest_kept=event-204`\n- Exercised the other crates from a second standalone consumer compiled with `rustc --edition 2021 ... --extern tank_core=... --extern tank_data=... --extern tank_tui=... --extern tank_scenarios=...`. Key output:\n  - `PRESET_IDS source=[\"soft_acidic\", \"moderate\", \"hard_shrimp\", \"ro_like\"] ... scenarios=[\"nano_cycle\", \"medium_planted\", \"warm_room\"]`\n  - `PRESET_LOAD source=soft_acidic ph=6.6 substrate=active_planted cec=0.9 plant=root_rosette guild=RootFeedingRosette shrimp=neocaridina_davidi species=Neocaridina davidi process=default nitrification_vmax=0.08 scenario=warm_room ambient_c=29.0`\n  - `SCENARIO_LOAD id=nano_cycle seeded_meta_id=Some(\"nano_cycle\") seeded_meta_notes=Some(\"Nano Cycle\") plant_guilds=2 substrate_layers=1 adult_shrimp=0`\n  - `TUI_INIT screen=Overview pending_actions=0 water_temp_c=24.0`\n  - `TUI_QUEUE screen=Actions pending_actions=2 first_action=Some(Feed { grams: 0.5 }) second_action=Some(ChangeAmbientTemperature { target_c: 26.0 })`\n\n## Automated Tests\n- `nix shell nixpkgs#cargo nixpkgs#rustc nixpkgs#gcc -c cargo check`: passed for all four crates; output ended with `Finished dev profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 5.24s`.\n- `nix shell nixpkgs#cargo nixpkgs#rustc nixpkgs#gcc -c cargo test`: passed; `determinism_basic`, `save_load_roundtrip`, `action_validation`, and `action_queuing` all succeeded.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Verification\n- [x] Cargo workspace compiles with four crates and `tank_core` has no TUI deps: `cargo build` passed; `cargo metadata` listed all four crates; `cargo tree -p tank_core` showed no `ratatui`/`crossterm`.\n- [x] `TankGeometry` has the required fields and derived geometry math: manual consumer produced exact expected values for volume, area, ratios, and closed-top factor.\n- [x] `WaterState` stores all required dissolved pools and ions as totals: verified in [water.rs](/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/water.rs).\n- [x] `TankSnapshot` derives `tan_mg_l`, `nh3_mg_l`, `nitrite_mg_l`, `nitrate_mg_l`, `phosphate_mg_l`, `do_mg_l`, `gh_d`, `kh_d`, `tds_mg_l`, `conductivity_us_cm`, and `ph` with the specified formulas: manual consumer printed expected values with zero diffs.\n- [x] `PlayerAction` defines all 12 variants with typed validation errors: verified in [actions.rs](/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/actions.rs), and invalid actions returned the expected `SimError` messages in manual testing.\n- [x] `SimEvent`, `EventKind`, and `EventSeverity` are present with the required shapes: verified in [events.rs](/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/events.rs); manual consumer created `SimEvent`s successfully.\n- [x] `SimSeed(u64)` wraps `ChaCha8Rng`, RNG is stored in `TankState`, and no thread-local RNG is used in `tank_core`: verified by `rg` and [rng.rs](/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/rng.rs) plus [state.rs](/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/state.rs).\n- [x] `SimulationEngine` is implemented and actions are queued/processed at the next hourly tick in insertion order: manual output showed actions pending before `step_hours(1)` and applied after it; automated `action_queuing` also passed.\n- [x] `TankState` contains the required top-level substates: verified in [state.rs](/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/state.rs).\n- [x] Save file JSON contains schema version, app version, full `TankState`, queued actions, and RNG state: manual save/load run printed `has_schema=true ... has_rng=true` and restored state/queue equality.\n- [x] `save_load_roundtrip` test exists and passes: confirmed by `cargo test`.\n- [x] `determinism_basic` test exists and passes: confirmed by `cargo test`.\n- [x] `action_validation` test exists and passes: confirmed by `cargo test`.\n- [x] `action_queuing` test exists and passes: confirmed by `cargo test`.\n- [x] Invariant checks run and enforce the required rules: manual run showed negative mass rejected, index-style values clamped into `0.0..=1.0`, and event log trimmed to 200; engine calls invariants from [engine.rs](/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/engine.rs).\n- [x] `tank_data` has TOML deserialization scaffolding and preset structs: manual preset loading succeeded; definitions are in [lib.rs](/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/src/lib.rs) and [presets.rs](/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs).\n- [x] All required preset TOML files exist: verified with `find crates/tank_data/data -maxdepth 2 -type f`, which listed all source water, substrate, plant, shrimp, process, and scenario files.\n- [x] `open_top = false` stores a configurable lid factor defaulting to `0.25`: manual geometry run printed `top_factor=0.250`; implementation is in [geometry.rs](/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_core/src/types/geometry.rs)."}}
